# IWC Network Design System

Medical logistics marketing site. Preserve this visual foundation on every UI change.

## Non-negotiables

- **Brand colors** live in `index.html` `tailwind.config` — do not redefine or replace with `blue-*`
- **Font:** Inter only (`index.html` Google Fonts + `font-sans`)
- **Styling:** Tailwind utility classes inline in components (no new CSS files unless asked)
- **Icons:** `lucide-react` only
- **Section order** in `App.tsx`: Gateway `/` → Courier `/courier` OR NEMT `/nemt`
- **Courier anchors:** `#services`, `#features`, `#contact`
- **NEMT anchors:** `#mobility`, `#services`, `#schedule`, `#compliance`, `#partners`, `#regulatory`, `#contact`
- **BusinessLineSwitcher:** pill toggle Courier | NEMT in subsite headers
- **Business data:** update verified license/NPI in `constants/businessInfo.ts` only — never fabricate in components

## Color tokens

| Token | Hex | Use for |
|-------|-----|---------|
| `brand-50` | `#f0f9ff` | Contact section bg |
| `brand-100` | `#e0f2fe` | Muted text on brand panels |
| `brand-500` | `#0ea5e9` | Hover accents, hero badge |
| `brand-600` | `#0284c7` | Primary CTAs, icons, chat FAB |
| `brand-700` | `#0369a1` | CTA hover, chat gradient end |
| `slate-50` | — | Page bg, card bg |
| `slate-900` | — | Dark sections, form submit btn |
| `green-400/500` | — | Live status, success states |
| `yellow-300` | — | AI chat sparkle icon |

Neutrals: `slate` scale only. Accents: `green`, `yellow-300` as above.

## Layout

- **Routes:** `/` gateway → `/courier` (courier site) or `/nemt` (NEMT site)
- **Gateway:** split two-card chooser, `rounded-2xl`, stacked on mobile
- **Page shell:** `min-h-screen bg-slate-50 scroll-smooth`
- **Container:** `max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8`
- **Narrow container** (contact): `max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8`
- **Section spacing:** `py-24` on every major section
- **Section backgrounds:** Hero (image overlay) → Services `bg-white` → Features `bg-slate-900` → Contact `bg-brand-50` → Footer `bg-slate-900`

## Typography

```
body:           bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 antialiased
eyebrow (light): text-brand-600 font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-sm
eyebrow (dark):  text-brand-400 font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-sm
section title:   text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 (white on dark bg)
hero H1:         text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.1]
body (light):    text-slate-600 leading-relaxed
body (dark):     text-slate-400 leading-relaxed
card title:      text-xl font-bold text-slate-900
```

## Buttons

```
primary:     bg-brand-600 text-white hover:bg-brand-700 rounded-lg font-semibold transition-all shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl
hero primary: bg-brand-400 text-slate-900 hover:bg-brand-300 rounded-lg font-bold px-8 py-4
hero secondary: border border-slate-600 bg-slate-800/50 text-white hover:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg font-bold backdrop-blur-sm
header CTA:  rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold (bg-brand-600 when scrolled, bg-white text-brand-700 when transparent)
form submit: w-full py-3 px-6 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 text-white font-bold hover:bg-slate-800 shadow-lg
chat send:   p-2 bg-brand-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-brand-700
```

## Forms

**Labels:** `block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1`

**Inputs / textareas:**
```
w-full px-4 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg
focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 focus:border-transparent outline-none transition-all
```

**Chat input:** `flex-1 p-2 bg-slate-100 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500 text-sm`

**Success state:** `CheckCircle` icon `text-green-500`, retry link `text-brand-600 font-semibold hover:underline`

**Contact card layout:** `bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl` → left `md:col-span-2 bg-brand-600 p-10 text-white`, right `md:col-span-3 p-10`

## Cards and sections

**Service cards:**
```
group bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-100
hover:bg-white hover:border-brand-100 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300
icon box: inline-flex p-3 bg-brand-600 rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-brand-600/20
```

**Feature rows (dark section):**
```
icon container: p-2 bg-slate-800 rounded-lg border border-slate-700
title: text-lg font-semibold text-white
desc:  text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1
```

**Header:** `fixed w-full z-50` — transparent at top, `bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-md py-3` when scrolled. Logo: Truck icon in `p-2 rounded-lg bg-brand-600 text-white` (inverted when not scrolled).

**Hero:** `h-screen min-h-[600px]` with `bg-slate-900/70` image overlay and `bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900` fade.

## AI chat

- **FAB:** `fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-40 p-4 rounded-full bg-brand-600 text-white shadow-2xl hover:scale-110`
- **Window:** `fixed bottom-6 right-6 w-full sm:w-[380px] bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border border-slate-100`
- **Header:** `bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-brand-700 p-4 text-white`
- **User bubble:** `bg-brand-600 text-white rounded-2xl rounded-br-none`
- **Model bubble:** `bg-white text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm rounded-2xl rounded-bl-none`

## Motion

- Default transition: `transition-all duration-300`
- Card icon hover: `group-hover:scale-110`
- CTA hover: shadow elevation (`hover:shadow-xl`, `hover:shadow-2xl`)

## Do / Don't

**Do**
- Use `brand-*` for all primary blues
- Keep `py-24` section rhythm and `max-w-7xl` containers
- Match existing form field classes when adding inputs
- Use gradient text sparingly: `text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-300 to-white` (hero only)

**Don't**
- Swap `brand-*` for `blue-*`, `sky-*`, or custom hex in className
- Change font away from Inter
- Remove or reorder core sections without explicit request
- Introduce new icon libraries (Font Awesome, Heroicons, etc.)
- Add purple/orange palettes or non-medical consumer aesthetics
- Break the contact split-card layout for quote/request forms
